</strong><span>Portfolio Portraits</span></div><div class="stat-divider">/</div><div class="stat-cell"><strong>Bespoke</strong><span>Lighting & Art Direction</span></div></div></div><div class="masthead-action-box"><a href="#inquire" class="masthead-cta">Plan Your Session <span>↗</span></a><a href="tel:+12513491744" class="masthead-phone">📞 (251) 349-1744</a><span class="masthead-note">Serving Baldwin & Mobile County</span></div></div><!-- Curated Session Highlights Bar (Gold-Accented Studio Editions) --><div class="session-strip" role="region" aria-label="Curated session highlights"><a class="session-strip-item" href="/sessions/seniors/"><div class="strip-ring"><div class="strip-thumb"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/thumb-01.webp" alt="Senior Portraits" loading="lazy"></div></div><span class="strip-title">Senior</span><small class="strip-count">21 photos</small></a><a class="session-strip-item" href="/sessions/tux-drape/"><div class="strip-ring"><div class="strip-thumb"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/thumb-07.webp" alt="Tux, Drape &amp; Cap and Gown Portraits" loading="lazy"></div></div><span class="strip-title">Tux,</span><small class="strip-count">6 photos</small></a><a class="session-strip-item" href="/sessions/sports-individual/"><div class="strip-ring"><div class="strip-thumb"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/sports-04-thumb.webp" alt="Individual Sports Portraits" loading="lazy"></div></div><span class="strip-title">Individual</span><small class="strip-count">23 photos</small></a><a class="session-strip-item" href="/sessions/newborns/"><div class="strip-ring"><div class="strip-thumb"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/newborn-03-thumb.webp" alt="Newborn Portraits" loading="lazy"></div></div><span class="strip-title">Newborn</span><small class="strip-count">15 photos</small></a><a class="session-strip-item" href="/sessions/maternity/"><div class="strip-ring"><d