eative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/newborn-21-thumb.webp" alt="Preschool Photography" loading="lazy"></div></div><span class="strip-title">Preschool</span><small class="strip-count">10 photos</small></a></div></section><!-- Editorial Lookbook Cards Section --><section class="portfolio wrap" id="specialties"><div class="lookbook-controls"><div class="lookbook-tabs"><button class="lookbook-tab active" data-tab="specialties"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="14" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/></svg><span>STUDIO COLLECTIONS (11)</span></button><button class="lookbook-tab" data-tab="portraits"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><span>ALL PORTFOLIO HIGHLIGHTS (26)</span></button></div><button class="inspiration" data-saved aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><span>Saved Inspiration</span><b id="savecount">0</b></button></div><!-- Category Filter Bar --><div class="filterbar" role="group" aria-label="Filter shoot collections"><button data-filter="All Sessions" class="current" aria-pressed="true">All Sessions</button><button data-filter="Seniors" class aria-pressed="false">Seniors</button><button data-filter="Athletics" class aria-pressed="false">Athletics</button><button data-filter="Coastal" class aria-pressed="false">Coastal</button><button data-filter="Studio" class aria-pressed="false">Studio</button><button data-filter="Teams" class aria-pressed="false">Teams</button><button data-filter="Milestone" class aria-pressed="false">Milestone</button></div><div class="resultline"><span id="resultcount">11 shoot collections to explore</span><span>SELECT ANY COLLECTION TO OPEN ITS COMPLETE PHOTO GRID ↗</span></div><!-- 3-Column Luxury Lookbook Card Grid --><div class="lookbook-grid" id="specialties-grid"><article class="lookbook-card" data-specialty-id="seniors" data-category="Seniors"><!-- Card Header --><div class="card-topline"><div class="card-series-tag"><span class="series-num">VOL. 01</span><span class="series-sep">·</span><span class="series-badge">Signature</span></div><span class="card-location">Daphne · Fairhope, AL</span></div><!-- 4:5 Photo Frame with Direct Click to Gallery --><a class="card-photo-frame" href="/sessions/seniors/" aria-label="View Senior Portraits photo grid"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/thumb-01.webp" alt="Senior Portraits" width="480" height="600" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"><div class="frame-hover-shade"><div class="hover-cta-pill"><span>Explore 21 Portraits</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div></a><!-- Card Bottom Editorial Details --><div class="card-editorial-body"><div class="card-headline-row"><h3 class="card-title"><a href="/sessions/seniors/">Senior Portraits</a></h3><button class="favorite-star-btn" data-save-id="seniors" aria-label="Save to inspiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></button></div><p class="card-narrative">Bold, editorial-style senior portraits that celebrate your personality, style, and achievements. Unforgettable lighting and art direction on location across the Eastern Shore.</p><div class="card-action-bar"><a class="card-grid-btn" href="/sessions/seniors/">View Photo Grid <span>↗</span></a><button class="card-quick-detail-btn" data-modal="seniors">Session Info</button></div></div></article><article class="lookbook-card" data-specialty-id="tux-drape" data-category="Formal"><!-- Card Header --><div class="card-topline"><div class="card-series-tag"><span class="series-num">VOL. 02</span><span class="series-sep">·</span><span class="series-badge">Studio</span></div><span class="card-location">Daphne Home Studio</span></div><!-- 4:5 Photo Frame with Direct Click to Gallery --><a class="card-photo-frame" href="/sessions/tux-drape/" aria-label="View Tux, Drape &amp; Cap and Gown Portraits photo grid"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/thumb-07.webp" alt="Tux, Drape &amp; Cap and Gown Portraits" width="480" height="600" loading="eager" fetchpriority="auto"><div class="frame-hover-shade"><div class="hover-cta-pill"><span>Explore 6 Portraits</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div></a><!-- Card Bottom Editorial Details --><div class="card-editorial-body"><div class="card-headline-row"><h3 class="card-title"><a href="/sessions/tux-drape/">Tux, Drape &amp; Cap and Gown Portraits</a></h3><button class="favorite-star-btn" data-save-id="tux-drape" aria-label="Save to inspiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></button></div><p class="card-narrative">The timeless, formal side of senior year captured in our dedicated Daphne home studio. Classic drape, tuxedo, and cap &amp; gown portraits crafted for family heirlooms an