a class="card-grid-btn" href="/sessions/sports-individual/">View Photo Grid <span>↗</span></a><button class="card-quick-detail-btn" data-modal="sports-individual">Session Info</button></div></div></article><article class="lookbook-card" data-specialty-id="newborns" data-category="Studio"><!-- Card Header --><div class="card-topline"><div class="card-series-tag"><span class="series-num">VOL. 04</span><span class="series-sep">·</span><span class="series-badge">Studio</span></div><span class="card-location">Daphne Studio</span></div><!-- 4:5 Photo Frame with Direct Click to Gallery --><a class="card-photo-frame" href="/sessions/newborns/" aria-label="View Newborn Portraits photo grid"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/newborn-03-thumb.webp" alt="Newborn Portraits" width="480" height="600" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto"><div class="frame-hover-shade"><div class="hover-cta-pill"><span>Explore 15 Portraits</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div></a><!-- Card Bottom Editorial Details --><div class="card-editorial-body"><div class="card-headline-row"><h3 class="card-title"><a href="/sessions/newborns/">Newborn Portraits</a></h3><button class="favorite-star-btn" data-save-id="newborns" aria-label="Save to inspiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></button></div><p class="card-narrative">Calm, thoughtfully styled newborn sessions in our temperature-controlled Daphne studio. Gentle posing, cozy wraps, and heirloom imagery captured during baby&#39;s first weeks.</p><div class="card-action-bar"><a class="card-grid-btn" href="/sessions/newborns/">View Photo Grid <span>↗</span></a><button class="card-quick-detail-btn" data-modal="newborns">Session Info</button></div></div></article><article class="lookbook-card" data-specialty-id="maternity" data-category="Milestone"><!-- Card Header --><div class="card-topline"><div class="card-series-tag"><span class="series-num">VOL. 05</span><span class="series-sep">·</span><span class="series-badge">Milestone</span></div><span class="card-location">Gulf Coast Beaches &amp; Studio</span></div><!-- 4:5 Photo Frame with Direct Click to Gallery --><a class="card-photo-frame" href="/sessions/maternity/" aria-label="View Maternity Portraits photo grid"><img src="https://dixoncreative.flowwebdesigner.com/dixon/newborn-14-thumb.webp" alt="Maternity Portraits" width="480" height="600" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto"><div class="frame-hover-shade"><div class="hover-cta-pill"><span>Explore 8 Portraits</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div></a><!-- Card Bottom Editorial Details --><div class="card-editorial-body"><div class="card-headline-row"><h3 class="card-title"><a href="/sessions/maternity/">Maternity Portraits</a></h3><button class="favorite-star-btn" data-save-id="maternity" aria-label="Save to inspiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></button></div><p class="card-narrative">Luminous, graceful maternity sessions celebrating motherhood and anticipation. Available in our warm Daphne studio or outdoors during golden hour along coastal shores.</p><div class="card-action-bar"><a class="card-grid-btn" href="/sessions/maternity/">View Photo Grid <span>↗</span></a><button class="card-quick-detail-btn" data-modal="maternity">Session Info</button></div></div></article><article cl